{"key":"ChatWindow","text":"## ChatWindow\n\nThe **Chat Window** is a multi-provider AI conversation interface supporting\nGemini, OpenAI (GPT), and Anthropic (Claude) models.\n\n---\n\n@layout\nModel Selector | 0.18, 0.04 | Choose the AI provider and model: Gemini 2.5 Flash, GPT-4o, Claude Sonnet, and more. All requests route through a Cloudflare Worker proxy — no API keys are stored in the browser.\nMessage List | 0.50, 0.45 | Conversation history. User messages appear on the right, AI replies on the left. Long AI replies are collapsed — click ▼ expand to read in full. A ● ● ● animation shows the AI is processing.\nInput Box | 0.40, 0.90 | Type your message here. Press Enter to send, Shift+Enter for a newline. Click ↕ to expand the input area for longer messages.\nSend Button | 0.88, 0.90 | Click ➤ or press Enter to send. Click Copy Chat in the title bar to copy the full conversation as formatted markdown.\n\n---\n\n### Model Selection\n\nUse the **Model Dropdown** in the title bar to choose the AI provider and model:\n\n- **Gemini 2.5 Flash** — Google's fast multimodal model\n- **GPT-4o** — OpenAI flagship model\n- **Claude 3.5 Sonnet** — Anthropic's balanced model\n- Additional models appear as they become available\n\nAll requests are routed through a Cloudflare Worker proxy — no API keys\nare stored in the browser.\n\n---\n\n### Sending Messages\n\n- Type your message in the input box at the bottom\n- Press **Enter** to send, or click **➤**\n- Press **Shift+Enter** to insert a newline without sending\n- Click **↕** to expand the input area for longer messages\n\n---\n\n### Message Bubbles\n\n- **User messages** appear on the right\n- **AI messages** appear on the left with a provider avatar\n- Long AI messages (> 5 lines) are collapsed; click **▼ expand** to read the full reply\n- A **● ● ●** animation indicates the AI is processing your request\n\n---\n\n### Copy Chat\n\nClick **Copy Chat** in the title bar to copy the full conversation to the\nclipboard as formatted markdown, including model labels.\n\n---\n\n### Error Handling\n\nIf the API returns a billing or quota error, a banner appears at the top\nof the chat. It auto-dismisses after 20 seconds, or click **×** to close it.\n\n---","screenshot":""}